::  name       aurora signature length equality gate
::  shape      length - int (@u32) -> lawful - int (@u32)
::  invariant  answers 1 exactly when length is signature_length=64; answers 0 otherwise
::  example    64 -> 1 · 63 -> 0 · 65 -> 0
::  readers    Aurora · Glow Tend a1 unfinished · Ashvini
::  nib        equinox-e253-equality-second-v0 · STOA337
::
::  Ashvini equality · second pedestal gth cannot speak. The sur shape names
::  signature_length=64 (Ed25519 encoded length); this gate decides *exactly*,
::  not by a ceiling.
|=  sample=@u32
?:  (eq sample 64)  1  0
